{"id":"eid","lemma":"Eid","pos":"noun","rank":3364,"glosses":["oath"],"ipa":"/aɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bf/De-Eid.ogg/De-Eid.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Eides","plural":"Eide"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie stehen unter Eid.","en":"You are under oath.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745384","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to stand"},{"g":"under"},null]},{"text":"Ich möchte Sie daran erinnern, dass Sie unter Eid stehen.","en":"I'd like to remind you that you're under oath.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/746473","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"on it, on that"},{"g":"to remind"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"under"},null,{"g":"to stand"}]},{"text":"Was ist die Strafe dafür, unter Eid zu lügen?","en":"What are the penalties for lying under oath?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"punishment"},{"g":"for that, for it"},{"g":"under"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to tell a lie"}]},{"text":"Denken Sie daran, dass Sie unter Eid stehen!","en":"Remember you are under oath.","words":[{"g":"to think"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"on it, on that"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"under"},null,{"g":"to stand"}]},{"text":"Ich darf Sie daran erinnern, dass Sie noch immer unter Eid stehen.","en":"I remind you that you are still under oath.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be allowed","l":"dürfen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"on it, on that"},{"g":"to remind"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"under"},null,{"g":"to stand"}]}]}